- Confirm shop and household balances (0 days)
- Cover next week from stock on hand, no new order (0 days)
- Give Craig extra shifts and keep wage bill in check (0 days)
- Find out if the rent is going up (0 days)
- Watch spoilage and lost sales next week (1 days)

